			"Message": "refactor(Output): Standardize Tauri command names to PascalCase\n\nAlign the Tauri command invocations in the Output layer with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention. Update all process-related commands in `Source/Polyfill/Process/Polyfill.ts` (e.g., `process_get_exec_path` -> `ProcessGetExecPath`) and shared process health checks in `Source/Polyfill/Shared/Process/Proxy.ts` (e.g., `cocoon_extension_host_health` -> `CocoonExtensionHostHealth`).\n\nThis change ensures the TypeScript frontend correctly matches the Rust backend command definitions, which strictly adhere to the PascalCase standard across the CodeEditorLand architecture.",
